OL,3,GNEWSAData centre could impact ongoing
OL,4,AUnesco status
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn environmental organisation has
OL,7,Fconfirmed an eco-designation could be
OL,8,Fat risk if plans for a massive data
OL,9,Fcentre in it are progressed.
OL,11,FUnesco said if prospective plans for
OL,12,Fwhat would be the UK's largest data
OL,13,Fcentre went ahead in the North Devon
OL,14,FBiosphere, that would have to be
OL,15,Ffactored into any decision to allow the
OL,16,Farea to maintain its classification.
OL,18,FThe area is one of seven biosphere
OL,19,Freserves in the UK that Unesco says
OL,20,Fpromote and work towards a "positive
OL,21,Ffuture by connecting people and
OL,22,Fnature".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
