OL,3,GNEWSAData centre could impact ongoing
OL,4,AUnesco status
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Xlinks, the
OL,7,Fdeveloper of the data centre, said it
OL,8,Fwould take into account feedback as
OL,9,Fpart of an extensive consultation
OL,10,Fbefore submitting planning
OL,11,Fapplications.
